OL,3,AMan jailed for 15 years over Ulez
OL,4,Acamera blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who blew up a ultra-low emission
OL,7,Fzone (Ulez) camera in south-east London
OL,8,Fhas been jailed for 15 years.
OL,10,FKevin Rees, 63, detonated the
OL,11,Fexplosives in the camera in Wellesley
OL,12,FAvenue, Sidcup, at about 18:45 GMT on 6
OL,13,FDecember 2023.
OL,15,FThe device damaged cars and houses up
OL,16,Fto 100m away, with shrapnel hitting
OL,17,Foutside of a child's bedroom. Rees, of
OL,18,FHarcourt Avenue, Sidcup, was convicted
OL,19,Fin January at Woolwich Crown Court of
OL,20,Fcausing an explosion likely to endanger
OL,21,Flife.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
