OL,3,AMan jailed for 15 years over Ulez
OL,4,Acamera blast
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the trial, the retired
OL,7,Felectrical engineer told the jury he
OL,8,F"strongly opposed" the Ulez scheme and
OL,9,Fthe mayor of London, Lord Sadiq Khan.
